      "text": "Wonderful documentary! 🇧🇬\n\nA few extraordinary Bulgarian treasures that deserve worldwide recognition:\n\n• Boyana Church (UNESCO) – home to remarkable 1259 frescoes, considered among Europe’s finest pre-Renaissance artworks.\n\n• Heraclea Sintica – one of Europe’s most exciting archaeological discoveries of recent decades, still revealing new finds every year.\n\n• Madara Rider (UNESCO) – a unique monumental rock relief found nowhere else in Europe.\n\n• Provadia-Solnitsata – considered by many archaeologists to be Europe’s oldest prehistoric urban settlement.\n\n• Pliska and Preslav – the medieval centers where the Cyrillic tradition was developed and spread.\n\n• Beglik Tash and Belintash – spectacular ancient Thracian sanctuaries that continue to fascinate archaeologists and visitors alike.\n\nBulgaria’s nature is stunning, but its cultural and historical heritage is just as extraordinary and still largely undiscovered by the worl",
